  "name": "Pokémon Organized Play tournament prize (2004)",
  "category": "event",
  "description": {
    "text": "Mudkip, Torchic and Treecko were 2004 prize cards for sanctioned tournaments: holofoil versions of Ken Sugimori's art from EX Ruby & Sapphire, with the Pokémon Organized Play logo, a Poké Ball, embossed in the corner of the art, in silver on Mudkip and in gold on the other two. They reached sanctioned tournaments in the UK first, Mudkip in January 2004 and Treecko only in June, and North American ones from June to August 2004, Torchic among them at the side events of July's three Stadium Challenges. Ken Sugimori signed copies of the three at the 2004 World Championships.",
